---
import { site } from '@/config/site';
---

<aside class="chatbox" data-chatbox data-whatsapp={site.whatsapp} aria-label="Orientador digital de Nexera">
  <section id="chat-window" class="window" data-chat-window aria-labelledby="chat-title" hidden>
    <header class="head">
      <div class="identity">
        <span class="status" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div>
          <h2 id="chat-title">Nexera</h2>
          <p>Guía inicial automatizada</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="close" type="button" data-chat-close aria-label="Cerrar chat">×</button>
    </header>

    <div class="messages" data-chat-messages aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions">
      <div class="message assistant">
        Hola, soy Nex. Te ayudo a ordenar una necesidad y encontrar el servicio de Nexera más relacionado. Esta guía usa respuestas automatizadas; no reemplaza una evaluación del equipo.
        ¿Qué necesitas resolver?
      </div>
      <div class="choices" data-chat-choices>
        <button type="button" data-intent="ia">Aplicar IA</button>
        <button type="button" data-intent="automation">Automatizar procesos</button>
        <button type="button" data-intent="training">Capacitar al equipo</button>
        <button type="button" data-intent="consulting">Modernizar tecnología</button>
        <button type="button" data-intent="quality">Mejorar calidad de software</button>
        <button type="button" data-intent="person">Hablar con una persona</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form class="composer" data-chat-form>
      <label class="sr-only" for="chat-message">Escribe brevemente qué necesitas</label>
      <input id="chat-message" name="message" type="text" placeholder="Escribe brevemente qué necesitas" autocomplete="off" maxlength="400" />
      <button type="submit" aria-label="Enviar mensaje"><span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <div hidden data-chat-message-template><div class="message assistant"></div></div>
  <div hidden data-chat-link-template><a class="message-link"></a></div>
  <div hidden data-chat-choices-template><div class="choices"><button type="button"></button></div></div>

  <button class="launcher" type="button" data-chat-open aria-label="Abrir la guía digital de Nexera" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="chat-window">
    <span class="mascot" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="antenna"></span>
      <span class="face">
        <span class="eyes"><i></i><i></i></span>
        <span class="smile"></span>
      </span>
      <span class="body"></span>
    </span>
    <span class="mascot-name">Nex</span>
  </button>
</aside>

<style>
  .chatbox {
    --chat-accent: #45c7ff;
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 30;
    right: 24px;
    bottom: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .launcher {
    --roam-up: calc(-100dvh + 200px);
    --roam-mid: calc(-62dvh + 124px);
    --roam-low: calc(-28dvh + 56px);
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    align-content: center;
    gap: 1px;
    width: 76px;
    height: 82px;
    padding: 4px;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-hi);
    cursor: pointer;
    transform-origin: center center;
    animation: mascot-roam 36s ease-in-out infinite;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .launcher:focus-visible {
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .launcher::before {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    width: 72px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(69, 199, 255, 0.38), rgba(118, 90, 255, 0.12) 42%, transparent 72%);
    filter: blur(8px);
    opacity: 0;
    content: '';
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: mascot-trail 36s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .launcher::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1px;
    right: 54px;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(69, 199, 255, 0.34);
    border-radius: 12px 12px 12px 3px;
    background: #101d2b;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
    color: #c4f0ff;
    content: '¡Hola!';
    font: 600 11px/1 var(--font-sans);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(4px) scale(0.92);
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: mascot-corner-greet 36s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .chatbox.is-open .launcher {
    animation: none;
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
  }

  .chatbox.is-open .launcher::before,
  .chatbox.is-open .launcher::after {
    animation: none;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .launcher:hover,
  .launcher[aria-expanded='true'],
  .launcher:focus-visible {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }

  .launcher:hover::before,
  .launcher:hover::after,
  .launcher:focus-visible::before,
  .launcher:focus-visible::after {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }

  .mascot {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    width: 56px;
    height: 60px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 7px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35));
    transition: transform 180ms ease;
    animation: mascot-float 3.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .launcher:hover .mascot,
  .launcher[aria-expanded='true'] .mascot {
    animation: mascot-greet 650ms ease-in-out both;
  }

  .antenna {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 26px;
    width: 4px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(var(--chat-accent), #a45cff);
    transform-origin: bottom center;
    animation: antenna-sway 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .antenna::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: -3px;
    left: -3px;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #51d8ff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(69, 199, 255, 0.8);
    content: '';
  }

  .face {
    position: absolute;
    top: 9px;
    left: 4px;
    display: flex;
    width: 48px;
    height: 39px;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 15px 15px 13px 13px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(#111d2b, #111d2b) padding-box,
      linear-gradient(135deg, #45c7ff, #765aff 58%, #de58ff) border-box;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 14px rgba(69, 199, 255, 0.13);
  }

  .face::before,
  .face::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 13px;
    width: 5px;
    height: 13px;
    border: 1px solid #6ad9ff;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #122434;
    content: '';
  }

  .face::before { left: -7px; }
  .face::after { right: -7px; }

  .eyes {
    display: flex;
    gap: 11px;
  }

  .eyes i {
    width: 5px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #76e6ff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 7px rgba(69, 199, 255, 0.9);
    animation: eye-blink 4.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .eyes i:nth-child(2) {
    animation-delay: 2.4s;
  }

  .smile {
    width: 12px;
    height: 5px;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #cb7aff;
    border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
  }

  .body {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 14px;
    width: 28px;
    height: 11px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(69, 199, 255, 0.7);
    border-radius: 4px 4px 8px 8px;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, #152a3c, #241936);
  }

  .body::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 3px;
    left: 10px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #53d5ff;
    content: '';
  }

  .mascot-name {
    color: #c4d7e9;
    font: 500 10px/1 var(--font-mono);
    text-shadow: 0 2px 7px #080d16;
  }

  @keyframes mascot-float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-5px) rotate(2deg); }
  }

  @keyframes mascot-roam {
    0%, 3% { transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0) rotate(0); }
    10% { transform: translate3d(-22vw, -1vh, 0) rotate(-5deg); }
    18% { transform: translate3d(-50vw, 0, 0) rotate(4deg); }
    25%, 28% { transform: translate3d(calc(-100vw + 300px), -12vh, 0) rotate(0); }
    35% { transform: translate3d(calc(-100vw + 300px), -38vh, 0) rotate(-5deg); }
    42%, 45% { transform: translate3d(calc(-100vw + 300px), var(--roam-up), 0) rotate(0); }
    52% { transform: translate3d(-68vw, var(--roam-up), 0) rotate(5deg); }
    59% { transform: translate3d(-34vw, var(--roam-up), 0) rotate(-4deg); }
    65%, 68% { transform: translate3d(0, var(--roam-up), 0) rotate(0); }
    76% { transform: translate3d(0, var(--roam-mid), 0) rotate(5deg); }
    82%, 85% { transform: translate3d(0, var(--roam-low), 0) rotate(0); }
    93% { transform: translate3d(0, -10vh, 0) rotate(-5deg); }
    98%, 100% { transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0) rotate(0); }
  }

  @keyframes mascot-trail {
    0%, 4%, 25%, 28%, 42%, 45%, 65%, 68%, 82%, 85%, 98%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
    10%, 18%, 35%, 52%, 59%, 76%, 93% { opacity: 0.9; }
  }

  @keyframes mascot-corner-greet {
    0%, 23%, 29%, 40%, 46%, 63%, 69%, 80%, 86%, 96%, 100% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(4px) scale(0.92);
    }
    25%, 27%, 42%, 44%, 65%, 67%, 82%, 84%, 98% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    }
  }

  @keyframes mascot-greet {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0); }
    22% { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-8deg); }
    48% { transform: translateY(-2px) rotate(7deg); }
    72% { transform: translateY(-5px) rotate(-4deg); }
  }

  @keyframes antenna-sway {
    0%, 72%, 100% { transform: rotate(0); }
    82% { transform: rotate(18deg); }
    92% { transform: rotate(-12deg); }
  }

  @keyframes eye-blink {
    0%, 92%, 100% { transform: scaleY(1); }
    95% { transform: scaleY(0.15); }
    97% { transform: scaleY(1); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .launcher,
    .mascot,
    .antenna,
    .eyes i {
      animation: none;
    }

    .launcher::before,
    .launcher::after {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  .window {
    position: fixed;
    right: 24px;
    bottom: 112px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: min(370px, calc(100vw - 32px));
    height: min(520px, calc(100dvh - 110px));
    min-height: 360px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: #0b1420;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .window[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-height: 72px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    background: #101d2b;
  }

  .identity {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 11px;
  }

  .identity h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-hi);
    font: 700 16px/1.25 var(--font-display);
  }

  .identity p {
    margin: 3px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .status {
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #54d6a1;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(84, 214, 161, 0.45);
  }

  .close {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .messages {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 18px;
  }

  .message {
    max-width: 92%;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #d6e2ef;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }

  .assistant {
    background: #142333;
  }

  .user {
    align-self: flex-end;
    border-color: rgba(69, 199, 255, 0.25);
    background: rgba(69, 199, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .choices {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .choices button,
  .message-link {
    border: 1px solid rgba(69, 199, 255, 0.35);
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: transparent;
    color: #a9e5ff;
    font: 500 12px/1.35 var(--font-sans);
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .choices button {
    padding: 8px 10px;
  }

  .message-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 9px 12px;
  }

  .choices button:hover,
  .message-link:hover {
    background: rgba(69, 199, 255, 0.1);
    color: #d7f3ff;
  }

  .composer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
  }

  .composer input {
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1;
    height: 42px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13);
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #080d16;
    color: var(--text-hi);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .composer button {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--chat-accent);
    color: #04121c;
    font-size: 22px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .chatbox {
      right: 16px;
      bottom: 16px;
    }

    .window {
      position: fixed;
      right: 12px;
      bottom: 78px;
      width: calc(100vw - 24px);
      height: min(520px, calc(100dvh - 100px));
    }

    .chatbox .launcher {
      width: 68px;
      height: 74px;
      --roam-up: calc(-100dvh + 180px);
      --roam-mid: calc(-62dvh + 112px);
      --roam-low: calc(-28dvh + 50px);
    }

    .mascot {
      transform: scale(0.92);
    }

  }

  @media (max-width: 2560px) {
    .chatbox .launcher {
      animation: mascot-mobile-bounce 7s ease-in-out infinite !important;
    }

    .chatbox .launcher::before {
      animation: mascot-mobile-trail 7s ease-in-out infinite !important;
    }

    .chatbox .launcher::after {
      animation: mascot-mobile-greet 14s ease-in-out infinite !important;
    }
  }

  @keyframes mascot-mobile-bounce {
    0%, 12%, 100% { transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0) rotate(0); }
    28% { transform: translate3d(-48px, -12px, 0) rotate(-7deg); }
    43% { transform: translate3d(-64px, -4px, 0) rotate(5deg); }
    59% { transform: translate3d(-30px, -48px, 0) rotate(-6deg); }
    74% { transform: translate3d(0, -28px, 0) rotate(4deg); }
    88% { transform: translate3d(0, -8px, 0) rotate(-3deg); }
  }

  @keyframes mascot-mobile-trail {
    0%, 12%, 100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.8); }
    28%, 59% { opacity: 0.8; transform: scale(1.15); }
    43%, 74% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(0.95); }
  }

  @keyframes mascot-mobile-greet {
    0%, 15%, 31%, 100% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px) scale(0.92); }
    19%, 27% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
  }
</style>
